  "scope": "# Review: 9a94379ed070 cyclic rank-offset prototype\nTask/source: `9a94379ed070`, generator `4.0.0`, SHA-256 `393f2b9128bd987a1a4398d45f30128ff32dfe74e07352bf51529493cf0ed322`.\nCanonical rule: hash `ae44c1c82119`; exact program SHA-256 `57b79c20b9ed9bf5ad1ca8b4b2547a7ef6d598e6bd06677f674870bafc4a9130`.\nDefect \u2192 repair: the selected test used a task-relative canonical-data path; it now uses portable `reviewer_support` loaders.\nChange: added a task-local **proposed, unapproved** `rank_offset={0,1}` prototype; default `0` is byte-identical to canonical.\nCanonical/production behavior changed: **no**. Catalog approval, source authority, and training admission remain unchanged.\nFocused contract: **10 passed**; staged selected-task tests: **26 passed**.\nRetained evidence: 2 settings, 2 episodes, 4 demos, 8 queries, 12 Racket labels, 8/8 canonical pairs, 8/8 rival-differing queries.\nHardening: replay binds source/seed/program/generator identities and rejects changed, symlinked, out-of-inventory, or split-brain evidence.\nAdversarial result: 1-demo/12-query boundary episode passed with 13 distinct inputs; program/public tampering was rejected after manifest rehashing.\nStatus: routine prototype handoff; no remaining scoped failures.\n",
